{"reviews":[{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-0","r":5.0,"t":"I used this on my clients Knotless braids for the FIRST TIME\ud83d\ude0d","x":"So I was watching @dopeaxxpana onYouTube for a very long time, all her styles are always so neat & I just had to see what all the hype was about.. I LOVE THIS PRODUCT! I\u2019m loading my cart now lol. How can I get these in Bulk ???","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-1","r":4.0,"t":"It's good.","x":"I have to say when first applying it, it holds great and has a great shine that's not greasy. I also have to say is that it loses all that before an 8 hour shift is over. I don't  mind doing a minor touch up, it responds well. It is not sticky and doesn't leave a residue or becomes flaky like some. I would continue to use it and recommend it, I was expecting more because of the hype of its ability and holding power, long wear is the only thing that's coming up short.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-2","r":4.0,"t":"Smells amazing, but we\u2019ll see if this works\u2026","x":"Smells so good and is very firm when scooping out. There\u2019s a greasy feel to it. Reminds me of Let\u2019s Jam but firmer and NOT as greasy. I have 3b/3c hair and nothing really lays my edges or hair down for too long. This feels promising and I love the sweet smell. I always want to see the inside of products to get an idea of the texture and overall look, so I was mindful of showing that in the pics. Hopes this helps someone else.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-3","r":4.0,"t":"Think I found a keeper","x":"This is by far the best edge control I've tried thus far.. I finally found a keeper! Downside is that it does leave a white residue \u2013 BUT, only after using it in the same spot multiple days in a row.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"I was so amazed by this product.  I have a lot of hair and it is very dense and coarse 4C around my hairline and literally NO edge control, not even beeswax works as well as this does for me.  It straightens, shines, and slicks back with very little effort.  The only thing is it doesn\u2019t last long. But it is worth the money.  It compares to the Arcani edge control but a little better and much cheaper in price. Will definitely buy again.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-5","r":5.0,"t":"Best edge control by far.","x":"I love it! I have extraordinary thick hair. I\u2019m also \u201cnatural\u201d. So, this has been by far the best edge control to do my \u201cSenegalese Twists\u201d with.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-6","r":4.0,"t":"Love it","x":"This is a great product. The only thing it will turn purple. You should apply another product over it to reduce this issue","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great for laying my edges down","x":"It does a great job at laying my edges. I like the thickness of the product and I would definitely buy it again! Just when reapplying on unclean hair, apply water on top to thin out previous product and then apply. This insures that you don\u2019t get a waxy buildup.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-8","r":5.0,"t":"Blessed by Jesus","x":"This is purple magic. My daughter\u2019s 4c hair and my son\u2019s 2c hair both slick for days. Yes the edges hold for 24hrs only or a bit longer if you tie down. But it\u2019s the braids that need to be praised. Omg this stuff is from Jesus the Christ himself. The braids lasted for 3 weeks no retouch. It goes on thick and purple and doesn\u2019t dry white or flaky. Your hands might be greasy but not the babies\u2019 foreheads even when they sweat. Definitely rebuying. Thank y\u2019all.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-9","r":5.0,"t":"Love this .. best on the market","x":"[[VIDEOID:bd365d0296bb453b615014620da2ba90]] Holds and smooths hair excellent no white residue and works even better with the control foam.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-10","r":5.0,"t":"miracle worker","x":"I love this product i finally found something that literally holds my 4c hair in place without excessive amounts of gel. All you need is literally a finger nail amount and it swoops everything you add ur scarf on top and boom \ud83d\udca5 layed edges \ud83d\udc8b","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-11","r":5.0,"t":"Really Good","x":"I\u2019ve been trying to find really good gel, jam, and or edge control for a long time. I can definitely this is it. I use it for my braids. My ponytail and it works flawlessly. I never have any white residue, last all day and doesn\u2019t look greasy. I will be using this from here on out.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-12","r":2.0,"t":"Doesn't hold for a long period of time.","x":"When you first apply it it has a very strong hold but after an hour or so it starts to get greasy and loses its hold. I still use it when I won't be out for long but overall i'm disappointed. For reference I have 4c low porosity hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-13","r":5.0,"t":"Very Strong hold, long lasting hold","x":"I was surprised to see how strong the hold was and it lasted for two days on my thick natural hair. Black Panther made my hair look relaxed and little goes a long way. It doesn\u2019t leave a white residue either. Highly recommended","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-14","r":4.0,"t":"The shine and hold","x":"I dislike the smell a tiny bit. But it\u2019s not bad to the point i can\u2019t stand it! I loveeee the hold ! Really made my mouth drop since i spent over $100 dollars on edge control and this by far i recommended for natural hair !","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-15","r":5.0,"t":"A little goes a long way","x":"It works as advertised. It's very thick so you don't need to use a lot. I haven't had any white or flaky buildup. My edges stayed in place for a few days without me having to reapply the edge control.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-16","r":3.0,"t":"White Residue","x":"It gets chalky and white after using. Although the hold was strong for the moment I put it on, my edges still curled up. I would say it may work better with a different hair texture","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-17","r":4.0,"t":"Edges slayed","x":"I love the way it smells, the only thing if you don\u2019t rub it into your hair good it will leave a white residue. But it does good holding the hair down.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-18","r":4.0,"t":"Works well but the humidity here makes it curl up. Because, my hair is natural","x":"It really works well as long as I'm not working out. My hair is natural so it lays my hair down as long as I stay in the air conditioning.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-19","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"Worthless not as described. Wax type more than a gel leaves white residue on hair does not hold and will smudge instead of firm hold.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-20","r":3.0,"t":"not long lasting","x":"It was alright, however after about 2 hours it began to loss hold. You have to combine with got2b glue for a long lasting hold","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-21","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of time and money","x":"I put some on my edges by the time I walk to my room it was dripping down my face. Does not work AT ALL.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-22","r":5.0,"t":"Best edge control","x":"It made my 4c edges sleek down for 24-hours and daughter's for 3 days","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-23","r":4.0,"t":"Fine","x":"Works great, did get a little flakes from it. But the hold is good","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08H8RWPT1-24","r":1.0,"t":"It came opened and used","x":"Smells great but who used  this before it was sent to me?","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the strong hold that lays edges and slick hair effectively, especially on thick or natural hair.","cites":[5,6,9,11,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the hold does not last long, losing effectiveness within hours or a day.","cites":[2,5,9,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report white residue or a purple tint, though others say they experience no residue.","cites":[4,7,10,12,14]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently mention the product's pleasant smell and shine.","cites":[2,3,15]},{"text":"A few reviewers describe a greasy feel or waxy buildup, while others say it is not greasy.","cites":[2,3,8,13]}]},"qa":[]}